sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant AuthorResource
    participant AuthorService
    participant ServletUriComponentsBuilder
    participant PostgreSQL

    Client->>AuthorResource: POST /authors with Author body
    Note right of Client: Client sends POST authors with Author body

    AuthorResource->>AuthorResource: insert(author)
    Note right of AuthorResource: AuthorResource.insert(obj) invoked

    AuthorResource->>AuthorService: insert(author)
    Note right of AuthorService: AuthorService.insert(obj) called

    AuthorService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT INTO author (name, email) VALUES (?, ?)
    Note right of PostgreSQL: Author persisted to database

    PostgreSQL-->>AuthorService: return generated ID
    Note right of PostgreSQL: Autogenerated primary key (Long)

    AuthorService-->>AuthorResource: return author
    Note right of AuthorService: Persisted Author with generated ID

    AuthorResource->>ServletUriComponentsBuilder: fromCurrentRequest().path("/{id}").buildAndExpand(id).toUri()
    Note right of ServletUriComponentsBuilder: URI constructed using ServletUriComponentsBuilder

    ServletUriComponentsBuilder-->>AuthorResource: return URI
    Note right of ServletUriComponentsBuilder: Location URI for created resource (URI)

    AuthorResource-->>Client: ResponseEntity.created(uri).body(author)
    Note right of AuthorResource: ResponseEntity with 201 Created and Location header returned